== Behavior ==
A '''Minos Inquisitor''' reduces the player's total stats by {{Red|10%}} for each hit the player lands on it, up to a {{Red|40%}} stat reduction. The '''Minos Inquisitor''' gains a {{Stat|damage|6%}} buff for each second it's alive, stacking up to {{Red|600%}}. It can summon lightning on the block which the player is standing on, dealing more damage based on the current damage buff.

