== Trivia ==
* Before an emergency game update involving the '''Minos Inquisitor''' during the second [[Mythological Ritual]] event, the mob boasted an impressive {{HP|50m}} and reduced the player's damage by up to {{Red|80%}}, making it nearly impossible to kill within a 100-second time spawn.
* The '''Minos Inquisitor's''' lightning can be dodged by jumping.

